{"id":"00063","root":"uni00063_1","name":{"ja":"ロッカ","en":"Rocca"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ロッカ","en":"Rocca"},"element":"Science","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-01-16","limited":false,"characterId":56,"profile":{"ja":"米連の暗殺特殊部隊の一員。元々は海外の田舎に住んでいたが、魔族の侵略にあい、家族や友人、村ごと破壊されてしまった。その残虐な光景を目の当たりにしたロッカは強い復讐心を抱き、魔族を殺す事に人生を捧げていたところを、米連にスカウトされる。魔族の親玉は日本にいるという情報を入手していた彼女は、スカウトを受け、米連の暗殺特殊部隊員となる。武器は様々な物を使っていたが、それまで使える者がいなかったレールアローを簡単に使いこなしたため、彼女の武器として与えられる事になった。","en":"Rocca is a member of the United Nations elite assassination unit. She originally lived in a rural overseas village, but when demons invaded, her family, friends, and the entire village were destroyed. Witnessing that brutality forged a fierce desire for revenge, and she devoted her life to killing demons until the United Nations scouted her. After obtaining intel that the demon leader was in Japan, she accepted the offer and became an assassin for the United Nations. Though she has used many weapons, she quickly mastered the rail arrow—previously unusable to her—and it was assigned as her signature weapon."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"白瀬ほなみ","forms":[{"id":"uni00063_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[722,1444],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[105,210],"def":[108,216],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","90009"]},{"id":"uni00063_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1044,2088],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[160,320],"def":[166,332],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","90009","90010"]},{"id":"uni00063_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1366,2732],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[215,429],"def":[224,449],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","90009","90010"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"de